          </h2>

          <div class="faq-list">
            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary><h3>Is Ryse or Ghost protein better?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  For most buyers Ryse Loaded Protein is the better value, since it gives the same 25 g of protein per scoop for about $1.67 per 25 g against about $2.12 for Ghost Whey at the Amazon prices we saw. Ghost is better if you want added lactase, a soy-free label or only one artificial sweetener. Taste depends on which licensed flavors you prefer.
                </p>
              </div>
