                  Neither claims NSF Certified for Sport, Informed Sport or Informed Choice certification on its product page at the time of writing, and we did not find Ryse Loaded in those registries. That is not evidence of a problem, but drug-tested athletes should choose a powder with a verifiable certification, such as Dymatize ISO100, which Dymatize says is Informed Choice certified.
                </p>
