              <summary><h3>Is Ryse or Ghost protein good for weight loss?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  Both can fit a weight-loss diet: each gives 25 g of protein in about 130 calories, or roughly 5.2 calories per gram of protein. Neither is meaningfully leaner than the other. Mixing in water instead of milk saves more calories than switching brands, and a clear whey isolate gives similar protein in about 100 calories if you want something lighter.
                </p>
              </div>
            </details>

